  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math> be the origin. Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> be such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>20</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;and the vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is perpendicular to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;is coplanar with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
